containedTo.markdownDescription:
Restrict the `imports` target so it can only be imported from within this pattern. Shortcut for `only: true`.

**String form:**
```json
{ "imports": "**/internal/*", "containedTo": "src/features/$name/**/*" }
```

**Object form** (supports `unless` to exempt specific variable values):
```json
{
  "imports": "features/$name/components/**/*",
  "containedTo": {
    "path": "features/$name/**/*",
    "unless": { "$name": "shared" }
  }
}
```
